WEBVTT

00:00:02.560 --> 00:00:05.540
Present Day

00:00:05.250 --> 00:00:08.490
Present Time

00:00:16.910 --> 00:00:23.240
And you don't seem to understand

00:00:21.990 --> 00:00:28.440
A shame you seemed an honest man

00:00:26.690 --> 00:00:33.190
And all the fears you hold so dear

00:00:31.820 --> 00:00:38.460
Will turn to whisper in your ear

00:00:37.290 --> 00:00:41.860
And you know what they say might hurt you

00:00:40.030 --> 00:00:44.330
And you know that it means so much

00:00:42.590 --> 00:00:49.090
And you don't even feel a thing

00:00:47.790 --> 00:00:54.750
I am falling, I am fading

00:00:52.940 --> 00:00:58.870
I have lost it all

00:01:17.620 --> 00:01:26.890
I am falling, I am fading, I am drowning

00:01:25.340 --> 00:01:29.530
Help me to breathe

00:01:27.560 --> 00:01:34.740
I am hurting, I have lost it all

00:01:33.100 --> 00:01:37.280
I am losing

00:01:35.670 --> 00:01:41.480
Help me to breathe

00:02:09.920 --> 00:02:13.630
<b>Why? Why won't you come?</b>

00:02:14.170 --> 00:02:16.170
<b>I wish you would come here...</b>

00:02:43.830 --> 00:02:46.290
<b>Look! Look at that!</b>

00:03:03.490 --> 00:03:08.830
Why you should do that...

00:03:08.830 --> 00:03:12.880
...is something you should figure out for yourself.

00:03:21.830 --> 00:03:22.610
<b>Gotcha!</b>

00:03:25.080 --> 00:03:26.910
<b>Hey, cut it out!</b>

00:03:26.910 --> 00:03:27.740
<b>Why?</b>

00:03:27.740 --> 00:03:28.500
<b>Don't!</b>

00:03:28.500 --> 00:03:31.290
<b>What's the problem? Don't play hard to get!</b>

00:03:31.290 --> 00:03:34.330
<b>Come on, let's go someplace happy.</b>

00:03:50.870 --> 00:03:54.670
I...

00:03:54.670 --> 00:03:58.550
...don't need to stay in a place like this.

00:04:18.210 --> 00:04:19.630
<b>What the hell?</b>

00:04:19.630 --> 00:04:20.460
<b>What happened?!</b>

00:04:24.590 --> 00:04:28.220
<b>W-We don't know anything! W-We've got nothing to do with this!</b>

00:04:28.220 --> 00:04:29.380
<b>She came outta nowhere...</b>

00:04:29.380 --> 00:04:31.020
<b>Oh, no...</b>

00:04:32.480 --> 00:04:33.730
<b>Damn it...</b>

00:04:58.900 --> 00:05:02.360
If you stay in a place like this...

00:05:02.360 --> 00:05:06.070
...you might not be able to connect.

00:05:53.520 --> 00:05:55.100
<b>What a racket...</b>

00:05:58.440 --> 00:06:01.150
<b>Can't you be quiet?</b>

00:06:51.800 --> 00:06:56.220
Everybody, hurry...

00:07:04.460 --> 00:07:07.010
<b>Juri, don't make such a big deal about it.</b>

00:07:07.010 --> 00:07:09.550
<b>Yeah, it's just some stupid prank.</b>

00:07:09.550 --> 00:07:11.340
<b>B-But...</b>

00:07:19.060 --> 00:07:20.140
<b>It'll be okay.</b>

00:07:25.150 --> 00:07:26.070
<b>Lain?</b>

00:07:28.400 --> 00:07:30.530
<b>Did you get one, too?</b>

00:07:32.860 --> 00:07:34.160
<b>Get what?</b>

00:07:34.570 --> 00:07:35.780
<b>E-mail!</b>

00:07:36.580 --> 00:07:37.790
<b>E-mail?</b>

00:07:38.790 --> 00:07:41.410
<b>From Yomoda Chisa!</b>

00:07:42.250 --> 00:07:45.670
<b>I... I'm not very good with computers.</b>

00:07:46.460 --> 00:07:49.550
<b>You should at least check your mail once a day.</b>

00:07:49.550 --> 00:07:51.340
<b>Well, it's up to you, I guess.</b>

00:07:51.340 --> 00:07:53.300
<b>Lain's such a baby.</b>

00:07:58.930 --> 00:08:01.390
<b>Why is she crying?</b>

00:08:01.390 --> 00:08:05.730
<b>Because she got an e-mail from Yomoda Chisa, that's why!</b>

00:08:07.320 --> 00:08:09.400
<b>Chisa? Who's that?</b>

00:08:09.400 --> 00:08:10.820
<b>She was in class D.</b>

00:08:10.820 --> 00:08:13.400
<b>She killed herself last week by jumping off a building in Shibuya.</b>

00:08:13.400 --> 00:08:15.530
<b>Come on, the teacher told everybody!</b>

00:08:16.370 --> 00:08:17.990
<b>It's not just Juri.</b>

00:08:20.080 --> 00:08:23.540
<b>Lots of people have gotten mail from her this week.</b>

00:08:23.540 --> 00:08:25.710
<b>But she's...</b>

00:08:26.110 --> 00:08:29.410
<b>Right. You shouldn't be getting mail from a dead girl.</b>

00:08:29.840 --> 00:08:31.420
<b>But there it is.</b>

00:09:27.420 --> 00:09:31.300
What's it like when you die?

00:09:31.300 --> 00:09:34.260
It really hurts. :)

00:11:08.160 --> 00:11:10.460
Powering up... Working...

00:11:10.460 --> 00:11:13.610
Just a little longer...

00:11:13.610 --> 00:11:14.880
Log in.

00:11:17.210 --> 00:11:18.590
<b>Who are you?</b>

00:11:30.160 --> 00:11:33.400
<b>Lain. Please say your name.</b>

00:11:33.400 --> 00:11:35.690
<b>La-i-n.</b>

00:11:36.770 --> 00:11:38.330
<b>Accepted.</b>

00:11:40.800 --> 00:11:42.470
<b>You must be Lain.</b>

00:11:43.700 --> 00:11:47.490
<b>Lain has mail.</b>

00:11:48.240 --> 00:11:49.580
<b>From who?</b>

00:11:49.580 --> 00:11:51.750
<b>Yomoda Chisa.</b>

00:11:53.210 --> 00:11:56.000
<b>Do you wish to read your mail?</b>

00:11:59.850 --> 00:12:03.590
Hello, how are you?

00:12:05.720 --> 00:12:07.230
<b>Hello.</b>

00:12:09.800 --> 00:12:10.960
<b>How are you?</b>

00:12:19.380 --> 00:12:26.390
<b>Lain, I walked home with you just once. Do you remember?</b>

00:12:28.450 --> 00:12:34.020
<b>I have only given up my body.</b>

00:12:34.020 --> 00:12:38.840
<b>By doing this, I can explain to you that I am still alive.</b>

00:12:39.940 --> 00:12:45.280
<b>I wanted to let you know this, Lain, so I sent this e-mail to you.</b>

00:12:45.280 --> 00:12:49.450
<b>Do you understand? It's okay if you can't right now.</b>

00:12:49.450 --> 00:12:53.960
<b>You will all understand soon. Everyone will.</b>

00:12:55.000 --> 00:12:57.270
<b>Why did you die?</b>

00:12:58.210 --> 00:13:03.430
<b>Rumor at school has it that this is a prank e-mail,</b>

00:13:03.430 --> 00:13:07.700
<b>but I want you to know that it isn't, Lain.</b>

00:13:08.600 --> 00:13:12.870
<b>Why? Why did you die?</b>

00:13:17.360 --> 00:13:22.920
<b>God is here.</b>

00:13:23.820 --> 00:13:24.820
<b>Huh?</b>

00:13:26.950 --> 00:13:30.930
God...

00:13:50.390 --> 00:13:54.230
<b>I ate lunch late today. I'm done.</b>

00:14:02.070 --> 00:14:03.280
<b>Mom?</b>

00:14:03.280 --> 00:14:04.570
<b>Yes?</b>

00:14:04.570 --> 00:14:06.320
<b>I got an e-mail.</b>

00:14:09.870 --> 00:14:13.160
<b>From a girl who killed herself last week.</b>

00:14:57.580 --> 00:14:59.940
<b>What is it, Lain?</b>

00:15:00.880 --> 00:15:04.550
<b>It's certainly unusual to see you in here.</b>

00:15:23.770 --> 00:15:25.150
<b>I...</b>

00:15:28.760 --> 00:15:32.680
<b>I was wondering if you could buy me a new Navi...</b>

00:15:34.200 --> 00:15:36.250
<b>Finally caught the bug, huh?</b>

00:15:41.540 --> 00:15:44.650
<b>You're in junior high now.</b>

00:15:45.460 --> 00:15:47.650
<b>Your friends are leaving you in the dust, right?</b>

00:15:47.970 --> 00:15:50.580
<b>I keep telling you that you should use a better machine.</b>

00:15:55.390 --> 00:15:57.790
<b>You know, Lain, in this world,</b>

00:15:58.720 --> 00:16:01.590
<b>whether it's here in the real world or in the Wired,</b>

00:16:03.650 --> 00:16:08.670
<b>people connect to each other, and that's how societies function.</b>

00:16:16.210 --> 00:16:20.680
<b>Even a girl like you can make friends right off the bat, Lain.</b>

00:16:21.170 --> 00:16:23.540
<b>There's nothing to be afraid of.</b>

00:16:24.690 --> 00:16:28.760
<b>I wonder why your mother can't understand that?</b>

00:16:35.780 --> 00:16:38.810
<b>I'm not scared.</b>

00:16:39.890 --> 00:16:44.360
<b>But why bring up your Navi all of a sudden?</b>

00:16:50.190 --> 00:16:52.720
<b>There's a friend I want to see.</b>

00:17:17.510 --> 00:17:19.560
<b>What happened?</b>

00:17:17.510 --> 00:17:19.560
Damn it...

00:17:19.560 --> 00:17:22.290
<b>We apologize for the inconvenience, ladies and gentlemen.</b>

00:17:23.060 --> 00:17:26.020
<b>The train is currently stopped due to an accident.</b>

00:17:26.020 --> 00:17:27.400
<b>What?</b>

00:17:27.400 --> 00:17:28.900
<b>Was someone hit?</b>

00:17:28.900 --> 00:17:30.610
<b>I can't believe this...</b>

00:20:12.270 --> 00:20:13.980
<b>Miss Iwakura.</b>

00:20:21.860 --> 00:20:23.220
<b>Miss Iwakura.</b>

00:20:23.490 --> 00:20:24.950
<b>Yes, ma'am.</b>

00:20:24.950 --> 00:20:28.220
<b>This will be on the test.</b>

00:20:39.130 --> 00:20:44.130
<b>Come to the Wired as soon as you can.</b>

00:20:46.840 --> 00:20:54.850
<b>Come to the Wired as soon as you can.</b>

00:21:34.140 --> 00:21:35.730
<b>Chisa?</b>

00:21:38.790 --> 00:21:41.400
<b>Where are you?</b>

00:22:05.970 --> 00:22:07.430
<b>Wait!</b>

00:22:31.560 --> 00:22:35.990
nan no tsumi mo nai hazu na no ni

00:22:31.560 --> 00:22:35.990
Although I must be innocent,

00:22:35.990 --> 00:22:39.900
nanraka no batsu wo uketeru

00:22:35.990 --> 00:22:39.900
now I am punished.

00:22:40.330 --> 00:22:46.200
jibun de maita tane de mo nai no ni

00:22:40.330 --> 00:22:46.200
I wasn't the one who sowed those seeds, but nevertheless

00:22:46.920 --> 00:22:53.110
sakimidareta hana tsumasareru

00:22:46.920 --> 00:22:53.110
I have to pull up the flowers that bloomed from them.

00:22:59.660 --> 00:23:04.300
shiranai koto to mo ienai ga

00:22:59.660 --> 00:23:04.300
I can't say I didn't know about it,

00:23:04.300 --> 00:23:08.750
katabou katsuida oboe wa nai

00:23:04.300 --> 00:23:08.750
but I don't remember taking any part in it.

00:23:08.750 --> 00:23:14.940
jiyuu wo takaku kawasareta ki mo suru ga

00:23:08.750 --> 00:23:14.940
I think my freedom cost me dearly,

00:23:15.470 --> 00:23:22.180
kokoro made yasuku utta oboe wa nai

00:23:15.470 --> 00:23:22.180
but I don't remember selling my soul so cheaply.

00:23:22.540 --> 00:23:30.230
Hey Hey kutabatte osaraba suru made

00:23:22.540 --> 00:23:30.230
Hey hey, until I die and say farewell...

00:23:31.250 --> 00:23:40.140
Hey Hey dare no te ni mo kakaranai

00:23:31.250 --> 00:23:40.140
Hey hey... no one can touch me.

00:23:41.660 --> 00:23:45.750
tooi yoru wo urotsuiteiru

00:23:41.660 --> 00:23:45.750
You probably don't know

00:23:45.750 --> 00:23:53.460
shiranai darou eien no narazu monotachi wo

00:23:45.750 --> 00:23:53.460
the eternal outlaws prowling in the distant night.
